WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.470
What is 8 − 2 × 3?

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:06.100
Plenty of people say 18.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:09.870
But multiplying comes before subtracting.

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:12.840
2 × 3 is 6.

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:15.360
8 − 6 is 2.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:21.013
Everyone in the world gets the same answer, because we all follow the same order.
